# The Walpurgis Hall (arena/walpurgis.js, build walpurgis_hall in ttl:walpurgis, design/data/arenas.toml [walpurgis]).
# Needs the placer to have run (~1 min after start): `ttl walpurgis where` must list the hall as placed (the gate on Clayman's
# throne dais needs clayman_castle too; it is not walked here). Each `expect` throws "ttl: expected ..." on a wrong answer.
# A soul enters by condition: Life 2 AND (a Legendary unique, a capstone stage ttl.story.hero / demon_lord, an invitation, or
# a booked walpurgis match). Bots hold no Legendary unique, so the invitation and the stage are the routes tested.
# The sleep after the entry outlasts the 4 second gate cooldown, so the return arch answers.
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] walpurgis: TtlBotWalA invited by an op", "TtlBotWalA entered the hall", "TtlBotWalA left the hall".
# Verify in game: the gate on Clayman's throne dais (walk onto it with and without an invitation), the Voice lines.
ttl walpurgis where
ttlbot spawn TtlBotWalA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotWalB
@sleep 2
# Creative: a Life 2 bot at world spawn has no arrival grace, and the rim's mobs (a Barghest on the ttl-ops run of
# 5de8ed4) can kill it between the teleport and the check.
gamemode creative TtlBotWalA
gamemode creative TtlBotWalB
kubejs stages add TtlBotWalA ttl.life2
ttl walpurgis uninvite TtlBotWalA
ttl walpurgis uninvite TtlBotWalB
@sleep 6
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalA allowed no
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalB allowed no
ttl walpurgis invite TtlBotWalA 1
ttl walpurgis invite TtlBotWalB 1
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalA allowed yes
# B is not in Life 2: an invitation does not open the hall to it.
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalB allowed no
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalA out
ttl walpurgis tp TtlBotWalA
@until 20 ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalA in
@sleep 5
ttl walpurgis walk TtlBotWalA back
# The arch sends the soul out on the hall's next poll: the first `expect out` came too early on staging (19/11 19:09:47,
# one "[ttl] walpurgis command failed" line in the log, then out the same second; the test passed).
@sleep 2
@until 20 ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalA out
ttl walpurgis uninvite TtlBotWalA
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalA allowed no
kubejs stages add TtlBotWalA ttl.story.hero
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalA allowed yes
kubejs stages remove TtlBotWalA ttl.story.hero
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotWalA allowed no
ttl walpurgis uninvite TtlBotWalB
kubejs stages remove TtlBotWalA ttl.life2
gamemode survival TtlBotWalA
gamemode survival TtlBotWalB
ttlbot remove TtlBotWalA
ttlbot remove TtlBotWalB
